This is an Ubuntu Linux firmware package.

This package was put together by the Ubuntu Kernel Team, from sources
and/or binaries retrieved from vendors and from upstream kernel.org.

This package is currently maintained by:
Ubuntu Kernel Team <kernel-team@lists.ubuntu.com>

Copyright information for the individual firmware files can be found
in /usr/share/doc/<package>/README. The individual license files can
be found in /usr/share/doc/<package>/licenses/.
